ong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","review_id":"cq4wav-vpcwEhMEW3prY4g","date":"2018-07-24T02:33:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9392642974853516,"text_excerpt":"The Davenport Lounge is now my go-to place for a relaxing evening. We arrived around 6pm on a Thursday evening and there was still plenty of seating. The band was really good, but must admit I was a tad disappointed that Jeremy Davenport wasn't playing. The service was great all around. My drink was okay, but I would probably keep it simple the next time around. We ordered several shareables and they were all good. The jam on the cheese plate was amazing and paired perfectly with the fruit and cheese. We shared the carrot doberge cake for dessert and I was quite intrigued by the lavender ice cream. I can't wait to go back."},{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","review_id":"NHehtCuriZGiU-C59SPW1Q","date":"2019-03-21T21:00:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9390169382095337,"text_excerpt":"Didn't have the time to check out the food as I only wanted to stop by to see some live Jazz. It was truly a treat to be able to hear Jeremy Davenport and his band play classic jazz in such a beautiful hotel like Ritz Carlton. I was there on Wednesday so he only played until 9:30pm. The lounge itself is classy, but very dark. I would imagine that this is a great place to bring your date for a fancy evening. The service is great. I didn't order alcohol at the time and just got some freshly squeezed juice instead. I'm not sure why, but I was given a pretty large bowl of chips and wasabi peas that I did not order. I'm assuming each party has these so that was really nice of the waitress. Wil..."},{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","review_id":"HeBDwHCxrK8NibX1kIAZ0w","date":"2012-12-11T22:09:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9303814172744751,"text_excerpt":"This is one of the nicer hotel bars in the city and I really like both the Ritz and the Davenport Lounge. The music is fun and the crowd is more upscale. The drink prices always confuse me as I get charged different amounts the vary with the bartenders. Jeremy Davenport is usually the main attraction and he certainly does a great show. I've been to many events and had many good times here. Of late on my last several visits the crowd has seemed to be trending much more mature..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","photo_id":"L6dgnteWO5HnPqLaQwKIUQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/L6dgnteWO5HnPqLaQwKIUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.864993691444397},{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","photo_id":"QS6Nhoekm12-iPp7WtqDUA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QS6Nhoekm12-iPp7WtqDUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8128417134284973},{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","photo_id":"1Erh7cyiI4y8pketQpjuQQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1Erh7cyiI4y8pketQpjuQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7838742733001709},{"business_id":"Hdr6aniNhzkxZCFhYgHNNQ","photo_id":"beUnO32Q9q0Q9HE5pMaFLg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/beUnO32Q9q